OL,3,GNEWSADetailed plans for golf course
OL,4,Ahomes submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer has submitted plans for the
OL,7,Ffirst phase of a project that will see
OL,8,F1,500 homes built on a town's golf
OL,9,Fcourse.
OL,11,FMaidenhead Golf Club moved from the
OL,12,Ftown's Shoppenhangers Road course to
OL,13,Fthe former Mill Ride Golf Club in Ascot
OL,14,Fin January to make way for the homes,
OL,15,Fschools and a local centre.
OL,17,FCala Homes was given outline permission
OL,18,Ffor the homes project, which includes
OL,19,Fbuilding primary and secondary schools,
OL,20,Fin February 2025 by the Royal Borough
OL,21,Fof Windsor and Maidenhead (RBWM).
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
