OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is now seeking to get more detailed
OL,7,Fproposals approved for 234 homes in the
OL,8,FSouthern neighbourhood, which would
OL,9,Fform part of the Elizabeth Quarter
OL,10,Fdevelopment.
